---
// filepath: src/components/Manifesto.astro
---
<section class="manifesto" id="manifesto">
  <!-- Marca de Agua Ambiental Decorativa -->
  <div class="manifesto-ambient-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="manifesto-bg-text">AMARGO</div>

  <div class="manifesto-head">
    <div class="section-label"><span class="num">01</span> MANIFIESTO</div>
    <h2>No diseñamos para ganar premios. <em>Diseñamos para que tu negocio crezca.</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="manifesto-body" id="manifestoBody">
    <div class="line"><span>Tu web no es un folleto digital.</span></div>
    <div class="line"><span>Es tu mejor vendedor, <em>trabajando 24/7</em>,</span></div>
    <div class="line"><span>sin pedir aumentos ni comisiones.</span></div>
    <div class="line"><span>Construimos <mark class="mate-mark">motores de crecimiento</mark> digitales.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(60px, 10vh, 120px) var(--gut);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Fondo Ambiental Texturizado con Presencia Visual Clara */
  .manifesto-ambient-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5%;
    right: -2%;
    width: clamp(320px, 50vw, 750px);
    height: 90%;
    background-image: url('/backgrounds/bg-ambient-1.webp');
    background-size: contain;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center right;
    opacity: 0.24;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
    filter: contrast(1.15) brightness(0.95);
    transition: opacity 0.5s var(--ease);
  }

  :global(body.theme-electric) .manifesto-ambient-bg {
    opacity: 0.28;
    filter: grayscale(80%) contrast(1.3) sepia(1) hue-rotate(40deg);
  }

  :global(body.theme-mate) .manifesto-ambient-bg {
    opacity: 0.26;
    filter: grayscale(20%) contrast(1.2) sepia(0.3) hue-rotate(85deg);
  }

  .manifesto-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--mute);
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .section-label .num {
    color: var(--bone);
    font-weight: 700;
    background: var(--mate);
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) .section-label .num {
    background: var(--electric);
    color: #0a0a0a;
  }
  .manifesto-head h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4.5vw, 64px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .manifesto-head h2 em {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  .manifesto-body {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .manifesto-body .line {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .manifesto-body .line span {
    display: inline-block;
    transform: translateY(110%);
    transition: transform 1s var(--ease-emphasis);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .manifesto-body .line.is-in span,
  .manifesto-body.is-in .line span {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .manifesto-body .line:nth-child(2) span { transition-delay: 0.08s; }
  .manifesto-body .line:nth-child(3) span { transition-delay: 0.16s; }
  .manifesto-body .line:nth-child(4) span { transition-delay: 0.24s; }
  .manifesto-body .line em {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  .manifesto-body .line mark.mate-mark {
    background: var(--mate);
    color: var(--bone);
    padding: 0 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) .manifesto-body .line mark.mate-mark {
    background: var(--electric);
    color: #0a0a0a;
  }
  .manifesto-bg-text {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 20vw;
    color: var(--mate);
    opacity: 0.04;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) .manifesto-bg-text {
    opacity: 0.06;
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto-head {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .manifesto-body {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    .manifesto-ambient-bg {
      width: 75vw;
      right: -10%;
      opacity: 0.18;
    }
  }
</style>
